# A variant sets each seat's start (CR 103.4, 103.5a, 402.2, 902.4, 902.5): Bot1 begins at 30 life with a starting hand of
# five, Bot2 with a starting hand of nine and a maximum hand size of eight. Bot1 takes the first turn and skips its draw
# (CR 103.8a); Bot2 draws a tenth card on turn two, plays nothing, and at its cleanup step discards down to its maximum of
# eight (CR 514.1), the newest cards by default. Bot1 keeps all six of its cards on turn three: its maximum is seven.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest x40

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40

[Variant]
Bot1: life 30; hand 5
Bot2: hand 9; maximum 8

[Actions]
? Bot1.Life = 30
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 9
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 30
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Hand.Count = 8
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
